                "frametrail:licenseAttribution": null,
                "frametrail:attributes": {
                    "text": "&lt;p style=\"text-align: center;\"&gt;Mansour’s family eventually came to Berlin in May 2019.&lt;br&gt;Due to the laws surrounding Tempelhof Field, the prefabs were taken down again in June 2019. Mansour, his wife and his daughter had to move into shared accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;",
